      "label": "Immigrant problem is mapped onto people running through a field",
      "description": "The text 'immigrant problem' is juxtaposed with the visual of multiple people running through a field, implying that these individuals are the 'problem' being referenced. This mapping equates the visual entity (people running) with the textual concept (immigrant problem), using the imagery to dehumanize and frame immigrants as a threat requiring action.",
